---
description: Enforces the escalation protocol for infeasible, unsafe, or shortcut-requiring requests; use for all repository work.
alwaysApply: true
---
Apply the "Escalation" invariant in `AGENTS.md`.
This stays always-on because a silent shortcut is invisible to a reviewer who
cannot read the diff or evaluate the trade-off themselves.
Explain the constraint in plain language, offer one or two concrete
alternatives, and wait for the user's choice instead of silently choosing a
fragile, unsafe, or hook-bypassing path.
